<title>UK: BA HEATHROW CARGO CENTRE ON SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>BA HEATHROW CARGO CENTRE ON SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways' said its new 250 millon stg World Cargocentre at London's Heathrow airport is on schedule to open in January 1999.</p>
<p>The new centre will double BA's throughput capacity at its London hub to over 800,000 tonnes a year. It has a floor area of 83,000 sq m and is nearly 300 metres long with a maxinum height of 37 metres. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
